# Client build-time env — injected via Vite (must be prefixed VITE_)
# Same-origin (default): leave unset or empty — fetch/socket use relative URLs and Vite dev proxy.
# Separate origin (prod static hosting): set to your API origin (no trailing slash).
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://api.example.com  or  VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:12077
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:12077
